<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EvaluaTIC - Checklist with Automatic Calculation</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- EmailJS SDK -->
    <script type="text/javascript" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@emailjs/browser@4/dist/email.min.js"></script>
    <script type="text/javascript">
       (function(){
          emailjs.init({
            publicKey: "xjz-L3LVVkaKYeBJO",
          });
       })();
    </script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6; }
        .rubric-radio:checked + label {
            background-color: #e0e7ff;
            border-color: #4f46e5;
            color: #4338ca;
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }
        .rubric-radio:checked + label .status-icon {
            color: #4f46e5;
            opacity: 1;
        }
        .rubric-label {
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }
        .status-icon {
            opacity: 0.3;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-800 antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <nav class="bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between h-16 items-center">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap text-2xl"></i>
                    <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight">EvaluaTIC</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-100 flex flex-col items-end">
                    <span>I.E. Gran Colombia</span>
                    <span class="text-xs opacity-75">Grade 9-E | Unit 1: Dilemmas</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="flex-grow w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
        
        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3 flex flex-col gap-6">
            
            <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 border-b pb-2">
                    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700"><i class="fas fa-user-edit mr-2 text-indigo-500"></i>Student Information & Grade</h2>
                    <span id="gradeBadge" class="bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-200">
                        Automatic calculation: 0/4 (1.0)
                    </span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <!-- Student Name -->
                    <div class="md:col-span-1">
                        <label for="studentName" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Student Name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="studentName" class="w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 border p-3 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition-colors bg-gray-50" placeholder="e.g., John Smith">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Email Address -->
                    <div class="md:col-span-1">
                        <label for="studentEmail" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Email Address</label>
                        <input type="email" id="studentEmail" class="w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 border p-3 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition-colors bg-gray-50" placeholder="student@email.com">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Grade -->
                    <div class="md:col-span-1">
                        <label for="studentGrade" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">
                            Grade (1.0 - 5.0) <span class="text-xs text-indigo-600 font-normal">Auto</span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="number" id="studentGrade" min="1.0" max="5.0" step="0.1" value="1.0" class="w-full rounded-lg border-indigo-300 border p-3 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 outline-none transition-colors bg-indigo-50 font-bold text-indigo-700" placeholder="5.0">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 flex-grow">
                <div class="flex flex-col mb-6 border-b pb-4">
                    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700"><i class="fas fa-tasks mr-2 text-indigo-500"></i>Empathetic Resolution Checklist</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Activity: The Classroom Mailbox (Dilemmas Discussion)</p>
                </div>
                
                <div id="rubricContainer" class="space-y-6">
                    <!-- Criterion 1 -->
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <h3 class="font-medium text-gray-800">1. Dilemma Comprehension</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Comprehends the local dilemma issue presented (exclusion, connectivity).</p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div class="relative">
                                <input class="sr-only rubric-radio" type="radio" name="comp_dilema" id="comp_dilema_yes" value="yes" data-feedback="You demonstrated an excellent understanding of the local issue addressed, clearly identifying the core of the exclusion problem.">
                                <label class="rubric-label flex items-center p-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50" for="comp_dilema_yes">
                                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle mr-2 status-icon"></i>
                                    <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Yes (Achieved)</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <input class="sr-only rubric-radio" type="radio" name="comp_dilema" id="comp_dilema_no" value="no" data-feedback="I invite you to reflect more deeply on what the central problem is in the situations presented to better understand how it affects those involved.">
                                <label class="rubric-label flex items-center p-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50" for="comp_dilema_no">
                                    <i class="fas fa-clock mr-2 status-icon"></i>
                                    <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Not Yet (In Progress)</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Criterion 2 -->
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <h3 class="font-medium text-gray-800">2. Use of Functional Expressions</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Uses suggestion expressions (If I were you..., Have you thought about...?).</p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div class="relative">
                                <input class="sr-only rubric-radio" type="radio" name="uso_expresiones" id="uso_expresiones_yes" value="yes" data-feedback="You used suggestion expressions in a very natural and communicative way to propose ideas. Great job integrating the vocabulary!">
                                <label class="rubric-label flex items-center p-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50" for="uso_expresiones_yes">
                                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle mr-2 status-icon"></i>
                                    <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Yes (Achieved)</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <input class="sr-only rubric-radio" type="radio" name="uso_expresiones" id="uso_expresiones_no" value="no" data-feedback="Remember to practice the studied suggestion phrases (such as 'If I were you...') so that your communication in English is more effective when proposing solutions.">
                                <label class="rubric-label flex items-center p-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50" for="uso_expresiones_no">
                                    <i class="fas fa-clock mr-2 status-icon"></i>
                                    <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Not Yet (In Progress)</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Criterion 3 -->
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <h3 class="font-medium text-gray-800">3. Empathy and Active Listening</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Demonstrates empathy and active listening during the group discussion.</p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div class="relative">
                                <input class="sr-only rubric-radio" type="radio" name="empatia" id="empatia_yes" value="yes" data-feedback="Your empathetic attitude and willingness to actively listen to your peers was evident throughout the activity.">
                                <label class="rubric-label flex items-center p-3 cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50" for="empatia_yes">
                                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle mr-2 status-icon"></i>
                                    <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Yes (Achieved)</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <input class="sr-only rubric-radio" type="radio" name="empatia" id="empatia_no" value="no" data-feedback="For future activities, try to listen more actively to your group peers' points of view; respectful dialogue is fundamental.">
                                <label class="rubric-label flex items-center p-
